#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:385
msgid ""
"When enabled (default) a detailed transfer window opens for every copy, move "
"or delete that is still running after two seconds; it can be collapsed into "
"the status bar. When disabled, transfers start collapsed in the status bar."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:389
msgid ""
"Show a completion summary after a transfer that was shown in the transfer "
"window"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:390
msgid ""
"The summary lists succeeded, failed, skipped, new and overwritten items, "
"checksum results, size, duration and speed, and offers Retry failed and Copy "
"log."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:394
msgid "Send system notifications for confirmed successful transfer batches"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:395
msgid ""
"Only confirmed successful batches can generate a success notification; "
"cancelled, skipped, failed or unverifiable operations never do."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:399
msgid "Retain local transfer history (up to 100 jobs)"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:400
msgid ""
"Store private native transfer summaries and up to 500 file records per job. "
"Disabled by default. History is not a resumable operation journal."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:404
msgid "Verify every copied file with a checksum"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:405
msgid ""
"On by default. Regular files are hashed while they are copied (the source is "
"read only once); the destination is then flushed to disk, dropped from the "
"page cache where the kernel allows it, read back and hashed again. A "
"mismatch marks the file as failed (retryable); a move only removes its "
"source after the destination verified OK. Same-filesystem moves are renames "
"and copy no data, so they are not verified."
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:414
msgid "Checksum algorithm used for copy verification"
msgstr ""

#: libnemo-private/org.nemo.gschema.xml:415
msgid ""
"SHA-1 is the default: it is the fastest algorithm offered by GLib (about "
"twice as fast as SHA-256) and is more than adequate for detecting accidental "
"corruption."
msgstr ""

